# gomobile output. Built by scripts/build-bindings.sh, never committed: the AAR carries a copy of
# the Go runtime per Android ABI and the XCFramework one per Apple architecture, which is around
# 100 MB of build artifact between them.
android/libs/*.aar
ios/Frameworks/

